; In-tree unit + property tests for smt/theories/lia. Depends only on oxsmt_core and
; oxsmt_lia, so it honors the dependency firewall (I3) even though it lives under smt/.
; Run via `make lia-test`; also built by `make build`.
;
; The independent Farkas verifier and the brute-force enumerator here are deliberately
; test-only and written from the certificate/semantics definitions (DESIGN §10), not from
; the solver internals.

(executable
 (name lia_test)
 (modules lia_test)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_lia))
